{"data":[{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:31:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113624334183150055"],"id":"2113624334183150055","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":169,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"那年猫神坐火车，卧铺对面是一对母子\n\n母亲真心地漂亮，男孩大概五六岁\n车刚开妈妈就接个视频，一聊就是半小时，笑得花枝乱颤\n\n小男孩憋了半天，皱着眉头说：“妈妈不许聊了，出来爸爸交待不让你勾三搭四，才上火车就忍不住了？关键又不帅”。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2113624334183150055"},{"author_id":"49216398","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:31:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113624283381743623"],"id":"2113624283381743623","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":185,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"中国网友与土耳其网友吵架\n\n算是两坨文明遗址之间的战争——类似俩木乃伊打起来了","url":"https://x.com/wuyuesanren/status/2113624283381743623"},{"author_id":"46574977","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:30:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113624134039081265"],"id":"2113624134039081265","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":583,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"企业领导者既希望接受更多培训，也希望有一个可以放心与同行互诉苦衷的空间，在这一背景下，高管教育项目正蓬勃发展。https://t.co/jPMeS8JHBm","url":"https://x.com/ChineseWSJ/status/2113624134039081265"},{"author_id":"98864871","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:28:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113622316584489106","2113623711639355473"],"id":"2113623711639355473","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":141,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"每天早晨打开邮箱，都是一排排的针对性很强的骚扰邮件。我一般都是直接删除，但最近几天的，值得拉出来给大家看看。\n\n最近几天的内容都是关于中国议会的。令我好奇的是，这些五毛水军对中国议会每天的动态甚至比我都还了解！我都不知道在法拉盛有什么活动（具体工作我从来交付秘书处负责）。 https://t.co/10G9MfAYdu","url":"https://x.com/wangdan1989/status/2113623711639355473"},{"author_id":"20845447","created_at":"2026-10-23T13:27:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113623425113612340"],"id":"2113623425113612340","lang":"zh","public_me